{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mech Fortress</i> offers a wide variety of maps to choose from, each featuring enemies with unique characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely arrange turrets on a 5\u00d75 grid and unlock more turrets through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/68195c5ecc16cb4a9e0602a7248d6b3c.avif?t=1764239079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turret placement is set before combat begins. The game includes an auto-upgrade feature, allowing for full idle gameplay with proper planning. Of course, players can also choose to upgrade manually for even higher potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face countless enemies and protect your base!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/83d116368db4419ef80be5500d1a0f34.poster.avif?t=1764239079\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/83d116368db4419ef80be5500d1a0f34.webm?t=1764239079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/83d116368db4419ef80be5500d1a0f34.mp4?t=1764239079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strongest fortress and defeat powerful BOSS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/3155c44c33dd0e810321f9d85892277f.poster.avif?t=1764239079\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/3155c44c3